// rowUp -- move the cursor down a row, closing the run, and set its y and whether it
// is drawn.
// Row dStop ends the walk (dpyBuf).
// Has no arguments and no return values.
// Does not preserve AC or IO.
// Called via jsp.
rowUp, dac ruX
    // every build passes here once a row, so the console is polled here, as the
    // typewriter holds one key and a build can outlast a typist; a break, or a lost
    // caller, leaves the list unfinished, dpyOn clear (dBegin) until the next idle
    // builds it
    jsp brkChk
    jsp rClose
    idx dRow
    SKIP_NEXT_IF_DIFFERENT dStop
    jsp dHalt
    lac dRow
    SKIP_NEXT_IF_DIFFERENT dFirst
